cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Swarm in your research, please cite it."
title: "Swarm: open problems from recent papers, verified verbatim"
abstract: >-
  Swarm reads the most relevant recent arXiv papers on a question in parallel with NVIDIA Nemotron, extracts the
  problems their authors say are unsolved, keeps only quotes found word for word in the paper, and ranks problems by
  how many independent author groups raise them.
authors:
  - family-names: Patel
    given-names: Nancy
repository-code: "https://github.com/nancypatel12/swarm"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - open problems
  - literature review
  - arXiv
  - Nemotron
